<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>A heart of love (echo)</l><l>Is one that’s kind, (echo)</l><l>Forgiving is (echo)</l><l>One of its signs. (echo)</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>I, child of joy (echo)</l><l>When friends are sad (echo)</l><l>With tearful words, (echo)</l><l>Will make them glad. (echo)</l></lg>
<lg label="4."><l>Peacemakers are (echo)</l><l>What we should be; (echo)</l><l>Speaking kind words (echo)</l><l>Making harmony. (echo)</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
